      "Text": [
        {
          "Text": "\"That's... that's horrible! I have heard rumors of there being Siths on Viscara, however. The Revanites, they are called, and they accept new members. Few people like them, though. They are Sith, after all. Monsters.\"",
          "Style": 0,
          "Color": null
